 Key Accountabilities 
 Setting up, configuring, testing, deploying and supporting Upstream’s SMS gateways in order to establish SMS connectivity between Upstream and its clients for the purposes of large-scale mobile marketing campaigns. 
 Collaborating with several internal and external technical teams in order to deliver the desired connectivity inline with other project requirements 
 Serving as the point of escalation for any SMS connectivity related problems for live projects 
 Participating in troubleshooting sessions with client technical teams 
 Proactively administering Upstream’s SMS Gateways in order to ensure the highest level of availability
