 Knowledge, Skills and Experience 
 University degree in Computer Science, Engineering or similar discipline 
 5+ years of hands-on experience with Linux/Unix systems and networking technologies, such as VPNs and switched VLANs. 
 Very good knowledge of TCP/IP, proven experience troubleshooting network connections 
 Solid experience of commonly used telecommunications protocols for exchanging SMS messages, including SMPP and HTTP 
 Hands-on experience with SMS Gateways, SMSCs and other mobile operator infrastructure components 
 Good programming concepts knowledge: algorithms, data structures, network protocols. 
 Excellent written and verbal skills in English 
 Other Considerations 
 Preference will be given to candidates, who in addition to the above requirements have the following qualifications: 
 Experience in working closely with Mobile Network Operators and associated third parties to set up and troubleshoot integration projects. 
 Hands-on experience with programming, preferably in Java or Python 
