MG Code offers integrated, large-scale, line-of-business solutions, firstly in the sector of credit risk and non-performing debt collection and recovery and secondly in the sector of Information Technology and Computer Science. It develops, offers and supports specialized integrated, informational systems and software solutions by utilizing state-of-the-art technology for law firms, enterprises and financial institutions. 
